    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your style. Do you prefer speed? Or maybe control? Or more damage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your strategy with satellite pedestals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave you will visit the shop, where you can buy, sell, upgrade and copy your crests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating enemies, you will gain essence that you can use for various purposes, such as acquiring improvements in the skill tree, new crests and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody Union, a small being with no memories, in its adventure within the world of Anima, along with various characters with particular situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your style. Do you prefer speed? Or maybe control? Or more damage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your strategy with satellite pedestals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave you will visit the shop, where you can buy, sell, upgrade and copy your crests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating enemies, you will gain essence that you can use for various purposes, such as acquiring improvements in the skill tree, new crests and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody Union, a small being with no memories, in its adventure within the world of Anima, along with various characters with particular situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.poster.avif?t=1746126104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.webm?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.mp4?t=1746126104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
